            </note>
            <note corresp="#d652-f2" n="39" xml:id="d652-f2-content">
                <p>Adm. Nicholas Horthy, Regent of Hungary; see circular telegram of August 18, <ref
                        target="#pg1127">p. 1127</ref>.</p>
            </note>
